  "name": "Open a High Interest Savings Account Online",
  "description": "Maximize your savings with the RBC High Interest eSavings Account. Enjoy competitive interest rates, automated savings tools, and free online transfers. Open your account today and watch your money grow faster!",
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "RBC Royal Bank of Canada",
